  "summary": "With an academic foundation in Computer Science from the Technion, I've honed my expertise in Go and cybersecurity at Palo Alto Networks, where I currently serve as a Senior Software Engineer. My core competencies lie in developing large-scale systems and ensuring robust cloud workload protection, underpinned by my extensive experience with Go's server-side capabilities.\n\nAt Palo Alto Networks, the team and I have successfully integrated Cloud Workload Protection with other services, enhancing data consistency for our users. Leveraging Google Cloud Platform's managed solutions, we've established cost-efficient inter-microservice communication. My commitment to collaboration and technical leadership underscores our shared goal of delivering secure and efficient solutions, and I continuously strive to bring diverse perspectives and innovative approaches to our organization.",
